{
  "dataset_assumptions": {
    "tenant": "demo",
    "seed": "demo tenant bootstrapped with stable templates and search corpus",
    "notes": "Use a clean DB snapshot before each baseline run to keep list/search cardinality stable. The nightly_baseline profile is intentionally pure-GET only — FLOW scenarios (document_generate_apply_headers, files_upload_flow, jobs_status_transitions) were removed 2026-05-29 (RB-002 caveat resolution) because they reference literal entity IDs (e.g. company_id=demo-company, person_id=demo-person, document_version_id=demo-document-version-id, template_code=Greeting/TMP) that bootstrap_demo_tenant does not seed (it creates entities with auto-generated UUIDs). When re-introducing FLOW probes: either (a) extend bootstrap_demo_tenant to seed entities with literal IDs and a Template(code=Greeting) + TemplateVersion(version=1) + a stable DocumentVersion, or (b) parameterize scenarios.json to discover seeded entities at probe time."
  },
